  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.8.0 — data curation (masking), a standalone inductive-free export, and two-R|L Loewner de-embedding surfaced through MCP (44 tools). New set_frequency_exclusions / set_point_exclusions / clear_exclusions mask measured points from analysis without deleting them (reversible; analyses use only non-excluded points and are NOT auto-recomputed — rerun kk / drt_* / guess_ecm / fit_ecm afterward); get_curve gains include_excluded with per-point Index/Excluded columns so masked points can be curated by index. New export_inductive_free returns the spectrum with the inductive stray (Ls + Rp|Lp + Rx|Lx) removed but Rs kept, distinct from the Loewner DRT de-embedding. The extra second parallel stray Rx|Lx is threaded end to end: drt_loewner accepts manual rx/lx, estimate_inductance and the diagnostics report it, and it appears in the Excel Loewner summary. Initial ECM guessing is now fully structural-analysis based (the legacy OrderOfTimeConstant Voigt-order machinery was removed from the engine; no tool argument changed). Fixes: Loewner Ls-type Rs over-estimation (de-embedded Z' < 0) resolved with the full eigenvalue set exposed; NaN-robust Loewner residual description; corrected stale two-R|L de-embed wording.",
